    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smokkehed is a music driven on-rails shooter set in a beautiful surreal world. Glide through wireframe landscapes and nebulas made of diamond as you shatter a dazzling array of shimmering glass enemies. Battle collossal Lovecraftian beasts and countless minions which pulse to the beat. Use your trusty head cannons to blast your way through over 20 levels of audiovisual mayhem.</p>",
